%% A realistic small state machine — mixes shapes, edge labels, and a
%% cycle. Good first thing to try after building the tool.
flowchart TD
    Start((start)) --> Idle[Idle]
    Idle -->|connect|     Connecting{{Connecting}}
    Connecting -->|ok|    Ready(Ready)
    Connecting -->|fail|  Failed[/Failed/]
    Ready  -->|disconnect| Idle
    Ready  -->|crash|      Failed
    Failed -->|retry|      Connecting
    Failed -->|abort|      Done((done))
